5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know if the money sorts itself out. Who pays for what?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need the total cost before we book. No surprises later.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I am worried about how we spend time together. Let us check the layout.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to know how much time is lost in transit.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I just need to know where I can sit and wash.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, if we know the all-in rate, the paying is clear, right?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes. If the rate includes everything, the bill is fixed. I prefer that.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree. But I also want to see how the rooms are arranged.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, the ferry schedule matters. If it is slow, we lose a day.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the bathing hours. I need to know when the water is hot.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will check the all-in rates. And what separately booked rooms cost last time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look into pricing of offshore houses let whole. And all-in rates against meals bought separately.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will investigate time alone in the shared-house year. And how last year's days ran.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check ferry sailings and train time. And getting around by train and bus.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at bathing hours and bathroom provision. And inn mealtimes and room arrangements.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Okay! Let us see what we find. I hope the money is simple.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I hope the numbers are clear. I do not like guessing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I hope we find a balance. I want us to feel close, not crowded.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I hope the travel is efficient. I want to arrive and rest.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I hope the water is warm. And the table is quiet.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
