35,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found that all-in rates make everyone pay the same, even if they eat little.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"I found that whole houses cost about 5,400 yen a head a night, plus food.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,I found that last year we drifted apart. We need a place that pulls us together.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The ferry leaves at 16:20. That means two days are gone before we even start.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The island baths are shared and the water runs cold. I do not like that.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, if we rent a whole house, the bill is one number. That is fair.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,Yes. But the food is extra. I need to know what that adds.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, if the ferry is slow, we lose time together. That is bad.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, the train is faster. But the island is far. I need to see the options.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, if the baths are shared, I will be uncomfortable. I need a door.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I think the all-in rate is the fairest. No one is left out.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. But I need to see the total. I will not guess.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,I think we need a place where we are together. Not a house where we hide.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I think the train is better. But I need to see the options.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I think I need a room with a door. And a bath that is mine.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Sakura,,Let us vote. I want the money to be clear.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I want the total to be clear. I will vote for the option that shows the full cost.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,I want us to be together. I will vote for the option that keeps us close.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I want to arrive and rest. I will vote for the option that saves time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I want to sleep. I will vote for the option that gives me a door.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
